sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant Cred as .credentials/<br/>google-oauth-raisd-sso.env
  participant Deploy as deploy-vps.sh sso
  participant Sec as K8s Secret<br/>sso-secrets
  participant Dep as Deployment sso<br/>gitops
  participant Pod as SSO pod
  participant UI as Login UI
  participant G as Google OAuth

  Op->>Cred: Write GOOGLE_CLIENT_* (gitignored)
  Op->>Deploy: npm run deploy:vps -- sso
  Deploy->>Cred: Read env file
  Deploy->>Sec: Apply GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / SECRET / REDIRECT_URI
  Dep->>Sec: secretKeyRef (optional)
  Dep->>Pod: Mount env into container
  UI->>Pod: GET /v1/meta
  Pod-->>UI: channels.google.enabled = true
  UI-->>UI: Show Google + Passkey row
  UI->>Pod: GET /v1/auth/channels/google/start
  Pod->>G: Redirect authorize
